      "message": "I\u0027m not fully convinced that\u0027s a better option.\nMaking it asynchronous (and in some cornercases late behind the BC1.2 detection) makes it difficult to understand and debug.\n\nI agree that we might fail a power swap if we are unlucky enough to have a battery badness at the same time but for the alternative we would need some kind of handshakes to ensure that the power transitions are happening before the PD events/deadlines.",
